msgstr "精确的 B-rep 几何；网格只是按某个选定容差做出的网格化结果"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:196
msgid "Shape sharing (one mesh, many links)"
msgstr "形状共享（一个网格，多个连杆）"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:197
msgid "Which part in which package a link came from - the digital thread itself"
msgstr "连杆来自哪个包中的哪个零件——也就是数字主线本身"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:199
msgid ""
"In the other direction, reading a URDF loses less than it used to but "
"still loses. Mass, inertia, friction, contact parameters and appearance "
"become named properties of the part and are written back on export; joint"
" types, axes, limits and dynamics become the ``motion`` and ``physics`` "
"of the generated interfaces when the assembly is converted to ASSY; the "
"geometry a link was not built from becomes a part of its own. What is "
"genuinely gone is the *effect* of a joint - the assembly is one "
"configuration, so a movable joint is a placement and not a degree of "
"freedom - along with transmissions, sensors and ``ros2_control`` blocks, "
"and the ``<origin>`` of geometry that ends up unplaced. PartCAD reports "
"the count of each rather than passing over them in silence, so the loss "
"is visible at import time and in ``pc info``."
msgstr ""
"反方向上，读取 URDF 的损失比过去少，但仍然有损失。质量、惯性、摩擦、接触参数和外观都会成为零件的具名属性，并在导出时写回；当装配体被转换为 "
"ASSY 时，关节类型、轴、限位和动力学会成为所生成接口的 ``motion`` 与 ``physics`` "
"；连杆没有用来构建自身的那份几何体会成为一个独立的零件。真正丢失的是关节的 *作用* "
"——装配体只是一个配置，所以可动关节表现为一个位置，而不是一个自由度——此外还有传动装置、传感器和 ``ros2_control`` "
"块，以及最终未被放置的那份几何体的 ``<origin>`` 。PartCAD "
"会报告各类丢失项的数量，而不是默不作声地略过，因此这些损失在导入时以及 ``pc info`` 中都是可见的。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:212
msgid "What it took to implement"
msgstr "实现它需要付出什么"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:214
msgid ""
"Worth recording, because the shape of the work says something about where"
" the gap is:"
msgstr "值得记录下来，因为这些工作的形态本身就说明了差距在哪里："

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:217
msgid ""
"**No change to the assembly representation was needed.** ``Assembly``, "
"``AssemblyChild`` and ``Part`` expressed everything the *geometric* half "
"of URDF needs, on the first try. That is the good news and the bad news: "
"the representation is exactly rich enough for shapes and placements, and "
"has no place at all for anything else."
msgstr ""
"**装配体的表示形式完全不需要改动。** ``Assembly`` 、 ``AssemblyChild`` 和 ``Part`` 一次就表达出了 "
"URDF 中 *几何* "
"那一半所需要的全部内容。这既是好消息也是坏消息：这套表示形式对形状和位置来说恰好足够丰富，而对其他任何东西都完全没有容身之处。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:222
msgid ""
"**The wrapper protocol had to grow a raw mode.** "
"``ocp_serialize.decode()`` turns an assembly envelope into a single "
"``TopoDS_Compound``, which is right for every other exporter and fatal "
"for this one - URDF *is* the tree. Hence "
"``wrapper_common.handle_input(decode=False)``."
msgstr ""
"**wrapper 协议必须增加一种原始模式。** ``ocp_serialize.decode()`` 会把装配体信封变成单个 "
"``TopoDS_Compound`` ，这对其他所有导出器都是对的，对这一个却是致命的——URDF *就是* 那棵树。于是有了 "
"``wrapper_common.handle_input(decode=False)`` 。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:226
msgid ""
"**Units and conventions cost a module.** URDF is metres, radians and "
"fixed-axis roll-pitch-yaw; PartCAD is millimetres, degrees and axis-"
"angle. ``wrappers/urdf_common.py`` exists to keep that conversion in one "
"tested place rather than spread across two wrappers."
msgstr ""
"**单位和约定花掉了一个模块。** URDF 用米、弧度和固定轴的滚转-俯仰-偏航；PartCAD 用毫米、角度和轴角表示。 "
"``wrappers/urdf_common.py`` 的存在，就是为了把这项换算集中在一处经过测试的地方，而不是分散到两个 wrapper 里。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:230
msgid ""
"**The parts a URDF points at have no declaration.** They are whatever the"
" URDF names, so they are materialized into the package in memory as "
"``<assembly>/<link>`` and the package resolves such a name by building "
"the assembly that owns it. A concept of \"a part that exists because an "
"assembly produced it\" did not exist before, and it turns out to be the "
"right one: those parts are ordinary parts, inspectable and exportable, "
"not an internal detail."
msgstr ""
"**URDF 所指向的零件没有声明。** 它们就是 URDF 所命名的那些东西，因此会以 ``<assembly>/<link>`` "
"的形式在内存中具体化到包里，而包解析这样一个名字的方式，就是构建拥有它的那个装配体。“因为某个装配体产生了它才存在的零件”这一概念此前并不存在，而事实证明它是正确的：这些零件就是普通的零件，可以查看也可以导出，而不是什么内部细节。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:236
msgid ""
"**Mapping the robot's root link to the assembly itself was a mistake "
"too.** It made an export come out with one link fewer, which looked like "
"fidelity, but it only worked because each part recorded which link it "
"*was*: the export matched the assembly node against a stored link name. "
"Once that stored name went away - and it had to, since the part is "
"already named after the link - the assembly went back to being what it "
"is, a container. An export now writes a root frame with no geometry and "
"every link fixed to it, which reads back as the same four placed links; "
"the round trip is stable, just one honest link longer."
msgstr ""
"**把机器人的根连杆映射到装配体本身同样是个错误。** "
"这样做让导出结果少了一个连杆，看上去像是更忠实，但它之所以能成立，只是因为每个零件都记录了自己 *曾是* "
"哪个连杆：导出时用一个存下来的连杆名去匹配装配体节点。一旦那个存下来的名字消失——而它必须消失，因为零件早已以连杆命名——装配体就回到了它本来的身份，一个容器。现在导出会写出一个不带几何体的根坐标系，并把每个连杆都固定到它上面，读回来仍然是同样的四个被放置的连杆；往返转换是稳定的，只是诚实地多出一个连杆。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:245
msgid ""
"**A link of several shapes is a sub-assembly, and combining them was a "
"mistake.** Merging a link's visuals into one generated shape made the "
"joint algebra fall out neatly - every part's origin was the link frame - "
"but it bought that by rewriting the model: the mesh files the URDF "
"pointed at were replaced by a generated compound and the ``<origin>`` "
"that placed each one disappeared into the geometry. Keeping them as parts"
" of a sub-assembly, each reading its own file at its own offset, costs "
"one extra term in the joint algebra (below) and a table of where each "
"link's item sits relative to the link frame. That is the right trade: a "
"digital thread that rewrites what it was handed is not one."
msgstr ""
"**由多个形状组成的连杆是一个子装配体，把它们合并是个错误。** "
"把一个连杆的视觉形状合并成一个生成出来的形状，让关节代数变得很整齐——每个零件的原点都是连杆坐标系——但它是靠改写模型换来的：URDF "
"所指向的网格文件被一个生成的复合体取代，而放置每个网格的 ``<origin>`` "
"也消失进了几何体之中。把它们保留为一个子装配体的各个零件、各自按自己的偏移读取自己的文件，代价是关节代数中多出一项（见下文），以及一张记录每个连杆的各个条目相对连杆坐标系位置的表。这是正确的取舍：会改写自己所接收内容的数字主线，根本不算数字主线。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:255
msgid ""
"**Nesting a sub-assembly per joint was also a mistake, for the opposite "
"reason.** It preserved the URDF's tree faithfully and cost an arm one "
"level of depth per joint, in a representation that has no joints in it. "
"Two different things were being expressed by one mechanism - \"these "
"shapes are one link\", which is grouping, and \"this link hangs off that "
"one\", which is kinematics - and only the first is structure. Flattening "
"the second and recording the relative placements in a table beside the "
"tree is what let the ASSY conversion keep the kinematics *and* the "
"assembly stay shallow."
msgstr ""
"**为每个关节嵌套一个子装配体同样是个错误，原因却正相反。** 它忠实地保留了 URDF "
"的树，代价是机械臂每多一个关节就多一层深度，而这套表示形式里根本没有关节。一种机制被用来表达两件不同的事——“这些形状属于同一个连杆”，这是分组；以及“这个连杆挂在那个连杆上”，这是运动学——而只有前者才是结构。把后者压平、并把相对位置记录在树旁边的一张表里，正是这一点让"
" ASSY 转换既保住了运动学， *同时* 让装配体保持扁平。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:263
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**An opaque properties section was a mistake, and the least obvious "
"one.** The first version carried what a URDF said under ``physics: {urdf:"
" ...}``, keeping the source format's own structure so that an export "
"could hand it straight back. It round-tripped perfectly and told PartCAD "
"nothing: a mass was a mass only to the URDF exporter, and no other part "
"of the system could read it, check it, or state one of its own. Copying "
"each value into a named PartCAD property with a PartCAD unit is more code"
" and a closed list to maintain, and it is what makes the property "
"*PartCAD's* rather than a souvenir of where it came from. The rule that "
"falls out of it - refuse URDF nothing maps, report PartCAD properties "
"URDF cannot state - is what keeps the list honest, because the "
"alternative to a loud failure is a quiet loss."
msgstr ""
"**一个不透明的属性小节是个错误，而且是最不显眼的那个。** 最初的版本把 URDF 所说的内容放在 ``physics: {urdf: "
"...}`` 之下，保留源格式自己的结构，以便导出时能原样交还回去。它的往返转换完美无缺，却没有告诉 PartCAD 任何东西：一个质量只对 "
"URDF 导出器而言才是质量，系统的其他任何部分都读不了它、校验不了它，也无法自己声明一个。把每个值复制成一个带 PartCAD 单位的具名 "
"PartCAD 属性，意味着更多代码和一份需要维护的封闭清单，而这正是让该属性成为 *PartCAD 自己的* "
"属性、而不是来源格式的一件纪念品的原因。由此得出的规则——拒绝任何无法映射的 URDF 内容，报告 URDF 无法表达的 PartCAD "
"属性——正是让这份清单保持诚实的东西，因为响亮失败的替代方案是悄无声息的丢失。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:274
msgid ""
"**The same went for the link's identity.** Recording which link a part "
"came from, and which link that link hung off, looked like cheap "
"insurance. It was two more things to keep consistent with the names and "
"the connections that already said it, and it let the exporter take a "
"shortcut that stopped working the moment the record was removed. "
"Hierarchy that has to be preserved belongs in the *name*, where a slash "
"already means containment; relations between two things belong in the "
"connection between them."
msgstr ""
"**连杆的身份也是同样的情况。** "
"记录一个零件来自哪个连杆、那个连杆又挂在哪个连杆上，看起来像是便宜的保险。实际上，它只是多出两样需要与早已说明同一件事的名字和连接保持一致的东西，并且让导出器走了一条捷径，而这条捷径在记录被移除的那一刻就失效了。必须保留的层级关系属于"
" *名字* ，在那里斜杠本来就表示包含关系；两样东西之间的关系则属于它们之间的连接。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:281
msgid ""
"**A cache entry is keyed by geometry, and carried an identity it should "
"not have.** Two parts that read the same mesh file hash the same, so the "
"second one came back wearing the first one's name and label. Nothing had "
"noticed, because nothing had keyed anything off those; the URDF exporter "
"names its links from them. Restamping on the way out of the cache, "
"exactly as the write path stamps on the way in, was the fix."
msgstr ""
"**缓存条目按几何体做键，却携带了它不该携带的身份。** "
"读取同一个网格文件的两个零件哈希值相同，于是第二个零件读回来时顶着第一个零件的名字和标签。此前没有人注意到，因为没有任何东西依赖这些信息；而 "
"URDF 导出器正是用它们来命名连杆的。修复办法是在出缓存的路径上重新盖印，就像写入路径在入缓存时盖印那样。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:287
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Two long-standing gaps in the interface code surfaced.** The schema has"
" always allowed ``ports: {name:}`` and ``implements: {iface:}`` with no "
"value, and both crashed - nothing had written them before, because "
"nothing had generated interfaces programmatically. Generating them found "
"it at once."
msgstr ""
"**接口代码中两个长期存在的缺口浮出水面。** 模式一直允许写不带值的 ``ports: {name:}`` 和 ``implements: "
"{iface:}`` ，而这两种写法都会崩溃——以前没有任何东西写过它们，因为没有任何东西以编程方式生成过接口。一开始生成接口，就立刻发现了它。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:292
msgid ""
"None of that was hard. The hard part is everything the geometry does not "
"cover, which is the rest of this page."
msgstr "这些都不难。难的是几何体覆盖不到的那一切，也就是本页其余部分所讲的内容。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:298
msgid "URDF joints as PartCAD interfaces"
msgstr "URDF 关节作为 PartCAD 接口"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:300
msgid ""
"This is the part worth dwelling on, because it is where the two models "
"actually have to be reconciled rather than translated."
msgstr "这部分值得细说，因为正是在这里，两种模型必须被真正地调和，而不只是被翻译。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:303
msgid ""
"A URDF joint relates two link *frames*: at the zero configuration, the "
"child link's frame sits at the joint's ``origin`` in the parent link's "
"frame, and the joint's ``axis`` says how it may move from there. PartCAD "
"does not relate frames; it relates **ports**, and its rule is that two "
"connected ports *face* each other - the connection composes the target's "
"placement, the target port, a half turn, the freedom-of-movement offsets,"
" and the inverse of the source port."
msgstr ""
"一个 URDF 关节关联的是两个连杆 *坐标系* ：在零配置下，子连杆的坐标系位于父连杆坐标系中该关节的 ``origin`` 处，而关节的 "
"``axis`` 说明它可以从那里如何运动。PartCAD 关联的不是坐标系，而是 **端口** ，并且它的规则是：两个相连的端口彼此 *面对面*"
" ——该连接由目标的位置、目标端口、一次半圈旋转、运动自由度的偏移量，以及源端口的逆变换复合而成。"

#: ../../source/simulation.rst:310
msgid "So one side has to carry the flip. The mapping is:"
msgstr "因此必须由其中一侧承担这次翻转。映射关系如下："

